  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1 - Critical Bug Fixes\n      • Fixed HttpClient base address mismatch between JupyterLabClient and BaseService\n      • Resolved circular dependency causing application freezing during startup\n      • Fixed JSON deserialization error in GetCurrentUserAsync with Permissions model\n      • Improved dependency injection configuration with shared HttpClient approach\n      \n      v1.0.0 - Initial release\n      • Complete JupyterLab Server API wrapper\n      • Authentication and security features\n      • Resilience patterns (retry, circuit breaker, timeout)\n      • HTTP response caching\n      • Rate limiting capabilities\n      • Comprehensive configuration options\n      • Full test coverage",
